Upstream baseline: ai 7.0.155 video generation, submission, status,
retry, and abort handling. Public @ai-sdk/provider-utils 5.0.70 helpers
are used as dependencies.

Modified to share one lifecycle across asset kinds, enforce explicit
submission idempotency, bind operation handles to their original model,
propagate hook failures with recoverable results, support cancellation,
and keep URL results as references. Sine AI's lifecycle and timeout
semantics are not a promise of drop-in compatibility with generateVideo.

See upstream.json and docs/UPSTREAM.md in the Sine AI source repository
for the reviewed source files and SHA-256 hashes.
